{"product_id":"elfbar-moon-night-40000-puffs","title":"Elfbar Moon Night (40000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eThe \u003ca title=\"Elfbar\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/elfbar-vapes\"\u003eELFBAR\u003c\/a\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eMoonNight\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e 40K brings next-level convenience, up to 40000 puffs in a single rechargeable device, engineered for long-lasting performance and rich flavour. \u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eMoonNight’s\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e dual mesh coil delivers smoother draws and brighter flavour across fruit, mint and dessert profiles \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf1\"\u003e— from Blue Razz Ice and Blackberry Ice to Dragon \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf1\"\u003eStrawnana\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf1\"\u003e and Pineapple Mango. The result is a consistent, satisfying inhale that highlights each flavour’s character.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eModel: Elfbar 40k Moon Light\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003ePuff Count: \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e40000 Puffs (Eco Mode), \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e30000 Puffs (Normal Mode), \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e25000 Puffs (